#!/usr/bin/env bash
#MISE description="Simulation campaigns under patina: every testbeds/<name>/sim.sh; never part of check"
# PRACTICES, Simulation with patina: exploratory, not a gate. Runs locally and nightly in CI.
# A testbed joins by having an executable sim.sh. Fails, never skips, when cargo-patina is
# missing or no testbed has one.
set -euo pipefail
cd "$(dirname "$0")/.."

if ! cargo patina --version >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "sim: FAILED: cargo-patina is missing (mise install builds it at the pinned revision)" >&2
  exit 1
fi
testbeds=()
for script in testbeds/*/sim.sh; do
  [ -e "$script" ] && testbeds+=("$script")
done
if [ ${#testbeds[@]} -eq 0 ]; then
  echo "sim: FAILED: no testbed has a sim.sh" >&2
  exit 1
fi
for script in "${testbeds[@]}"; do
  echo "sim: $script"
  "$script"
done
echo "sim: passed: ${testbeds[*]}"
